WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:13,820
Regarding the methylation, since you said I'm getting lots of natural methyl groups

00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:20,000
in my diet, heavy and greens, should I be looking for root causes? No, I would not. It really

00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,080
has to do with your genetics. There's not really any other root causes of a lack of methyl

00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:40,540
groups, but your genetics, your MTHFR gene and your MTR and your MTRR genes are really your

00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:44,920
root causes. But again, even if a person has those genetic defects, it doesn't mean they're

00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:51,720
going to have major issues, but certainly it predisposes to them to that. And if you did

00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:57,160
not have cancer, I probably would put you on methyl groups, having those defects. So I think

00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,160
it's time to discuss.

